{"seq":6,"slug":"rate-limiting-circuit-breaking","title":"限流、熔断与降级","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 限流、熔断与降级 简介\n\n让服务在过载与依赖故障下不崩溃，是后端工程的核心韧性课题。本 hub 面向需要构建抗压、抗故障服务的后端工程师，从限流算法（令牌桶/漏桶、固定与滑动窗口、分布式限流）讲起，覆盖熔断器的状态机、调参与降级回退超时，舱壁隔离、负载卸除与背压等隔离与卸载手段，以及优雅降级、客户端侧韧性与韧性的工程落地。贯穿全篇的主线是纵深防御与「为失败而设计」：超时是地基，限流控速率、熔断断故障、舱壁隔资源、卸载保核心、降级保可用——任何单一机制都不该独扛所有故障，且未经混沌验证的韧性不是韧性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-algorithms","title":"Rate Limiting Algorithms","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-bucket-leaky-bucket","title":"令牌桶与漏桶","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/token-bucket-leaky-bucket","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"fixed-and-sliding-window","title":"固定窗口与滑动窗口","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/fixed-and-sliding-window","wordCount":1442,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-rate-limiting","title":"分布式限流","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/rate-limiting-algorithms/distributed-rate-limiting","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲限流算法：令牌桶（允许突发）与漏桶（强制平滑）的取舍、固定窗口的边界突刺与滑动窗口日志/计数的精度内存权衡，以及多实例下用共享存储做分布式限流的原子性、性能与失效策略。核心是按下游承受力与是否容忍突发来选算法与参数。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breakers","title":"Circuit Breakers","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-breaker-states","title":"熔断器的状态机","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers/circuit-breaker-states","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"tuning-and-thresholds","title":"熔断器的调参","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers/tuning-and-thresholds","wordCount":1667,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"fallbacks-and-timeouts","title":"降级回退与超时","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/circuit-breakers/fallbacks-and-timeouts","wordCount":1663,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲熔断器：对抗级联失败的关闭/打开/半开三状态机、用失败率而非绝对数且排除 4xx 的调参之道，以及熔断必须与超时（韧性地基，让慢调用变成可感知的失败）和降级回退（失败时返回缓存/默认/简化值）配合的三件套。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"isolation-and-shedding","title":"Isolation And Shedding","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/isolation-and-shedding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bulkhead-isolation","title":"舱壁隔离","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/isolation-and-shedding/bulkhead-isolation","wordCount":1599,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"load-shedding","title":"负载卸除","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/isolation-and-shedding/load-shedding","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"backpressure","title":"背压","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/isolation-and-shedding/backpressure","wordCount":1736,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲隔离与卸载：用独立资源池/信号量把故障影响限定在一个隔舱的舱壁隔离、过载时主动丢弃部分请求以保核心并打破吞吐崩塌的负载卸除，以及用有界队列向上游传递「慢一点」信号的背压。三者按缓冲→背压→丢弃的层次协同应对速率失配。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"resilient-degradation","title":"Resilient Degradation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/resilient-degradation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graceful-degradation","title":"优雅降级","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/resilient-degradation/graceful-degradation","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"client-side-resilience","title":"客户端侧的韧性","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/resilient-degradation/client-side-resilience","wordCount":1667,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"resilience-in-practice","title":"韧性的工程落地","url":"/h/backend-engineering/rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/resilient-degradation/resilience-in-practice","wordCount":1661,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章把机制收束为韧性整体：让部分故障只导致部分功能丧失的优雅降级与功能分级、约束自身并遵守 Retry-After 的客户端侧韧性与重试风暴防范，以及把所有机制作为纵深防御组合、避免过度防护、用混沌工程验证、内化为「为失败而设计」文化的工程落地。\n"}]}